  "title": "NHS Flu Vaccine 2026: Older Adults in England to Receive Jabs From October",
  "summary": "The NHS has confirmed that the 2026 to 2027 seasonal flu vaccination programme for older adults in England will begin on October 1. The rollout is designed to provide protection closer to the period when flu is expected to circulate most widely during the winter months. Adults aged 65 and over will be among those eligible for a free NHS flu vaccine from October. The programme will also cover several other groups considered to be at greater risk from serious complications associated with influen",
